.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczm8z.jpg"}, {"id": 1661796, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczm90.jpg"}, {"id": 1661797, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczm91.jpg"}, {"id": 1661798, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczm92.jpg"}, {"id": 1661799, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczm93.jpg"}, {"id": 1661800, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczm94.jpg"}, {"id": 1661801, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczm95.jpg"}], "slug": "amanatsu-plus", "storyline": "A simple story about young love in the countryside at the height of summer.\nAlthough having lived in the city all his life, circumstances bring the protagonist to the countryside where he falls in love.\nAs the days go by, the end of summer soon approaches\u2014along with the Nanakayama festival.\n\n\"I'll... be Master's maid, meow!\"\n\"Come on over and be the zombie!\"\n(W-Were summer festivals always this chaotic...?!)\n\nThough unaccustomed to local events, the protagonist throws himself headfirst into the festivities alongside the girls.\nSummer is coming to an end, but a palpable heat continues to linger over Nanakayama.\nA time for all sorts of first experiences, like visiting your girlfriend and going on shopping dates.\nThese joyful days spent with your girlfriend aren't over yet.", "summary": "A story of adventure and young love by fan-favorite developers AZARASHI SOFTWARE. The protagonist returns to his nostalgic yet somewhat unfamiliar hometown, reuniting with past friends, stirring old feelings, and even finding love over the course of this fleeting summer's dream.", "themes": [{"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/amanatsu-plus"}